                <note rend="inline" type="source">738.39/286: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in the Dominican Republic</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Norweb</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Ciudad
                                Trujillo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1938-01-24T13:00:00-05:00">January 24, 1938—1
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 4:40 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>9. Legation’s despatch 116 [<hi rendition="#italic">166</hi>], January 19. The
                    Foreign Minister is leaving for Washington by air January 28.</p>
                <p>Repeated to Port-au-Prince.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Norweb</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
